  "details": "So, if you sort your Friends Wing by Location and there are multiple people in a World they will be Listed as they should be. But the first player will be over rendered by the player below and so on (Player / Cards in the Wings seem to be stacked on top of each other from the bottom up).\nThis results in the Player you are hovering above being over rendered by the Player that is below.\nThis could technically be fixed by moving the Player / Card you are hovering above to a higher Render Queue / moving it above the other Players / Cards etc.\nOn the image you can see that I am hovering above Gamersven but the \"Player Card\" from not_Tobo is still overlaying a bit on to the \"Player Card\" of Gamersven. The Card I am hovering above should always be on top.",
